00:54:56.680 --> 00:54:57.680
Or is it?

00:54:57.680 --> 00:54:58.640
Yeah.

00:54:58.640 --> 00:54:59.600
Is that?

00:54:59.600 --> 00:55:00.600
OK.

00:55:00.640 --> 00:55:03.480
That's one of the big unknowns.

00:55:03.480 --> 00:55:04.400
OK.

