China simply do not have a history of foreign interventions.

00:55:11.040 --> 00:55:11.280
Yeah.

00:55:11.280 --> 00:55:15.720
You could go into a handful of military interventions,

00:55:15.720 --> 00:55:18.200
Tibet being the obvious one.

00:55:18.200 --> 00:55:21.520
But they also fought a border skirmish in 1979

00:55:21.520 --> 00:55:22.720
