00:55:22.720 --> 00:55:26.120
They have fought several border skirmishes with the Indians.

00:55:26.120 --> 00:55:27.920
But just on the border, right?

00:55:27.920 --> 00:55:28.560
Yeah.

00:55:28.560 --> 00:55:31.760
They send navies and armies to the other side of the planet

00:55:31.760 --> 00:55:34.800
like we do to launch invasions.

00:55:34.800 --> 00:55:36.280
We do that.

00:55:36.280 --> 00:55:38.960
So the Chinese are going to stay out of it.

00:55:38.960 --> 00:55:40.680
They don't want any part of that.

00:55:40.680 --> 00:55:44.480
The Russians have nothing to lose, frankly.

00:55:44.480 --> 00:55:46.040
We're trying to overthrow Putin.

00:55:46.040 --> 00:55:48.920
We're trying to emasculate the Russian military.

00:55:48.920 --> 00:55:52.960
The Russians may want to get a jab in.

00:55:52.960 --> 00:55:57.200
And they've got very strong economic ties to Iran, right?

00:55:57.240 --> 00:56:02.840
Very strong diplomatic and military ties to Syria.

00:56:02.840 --> 00:56:03.560
Oh, correct.

00:56:03.560 --> 00:56:04.080
Yeah.

00:56:04.080 --> 00:56:06.800
Isbala are joined at the hip as well.

00:56:06.800 --> 00:56:08.040
Yeah.

00:56:08.040 --> 00:56:08.760
Wow.

