I think so.

00:56:33.320 --> 00:56:37.760
I'll tell you, I think what makes the situation over Taiwan

00:56:37.760 --> 00:56:42.800
so much more dangerous is that we involve ourselves.

00:56:42.800 --> 00:56:44.000
Yeah.

00:56:44.000 --> 00:56:47.320
We send carrier battle groups into the Taiwan Strait,

00:56:47.320 --> 00:56:49.280
