00:56:58.160 --> 00:57:03.320
We're the ones that have this policy where we think

00:57:03.320 --> 00:57:06.360
we're keeping the Chinese off balance.

00:57:06.360 --> 00:57:06.640
Yeah.

00:57:06.640 --> 00:57:08.760
And all it does is piss them off.

00:57:08.760 --> 00:57:10.320
Yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:57:10.320 --> 00:57:12.880
One of the things we're really bad at in this country,

00:57:12.880 --> 00:57:16.320
and we have been bad at this since the George W. Bush

00:57:16.320 --> 00:57:18.200
administration, is that we just don't

00:57:18.200 --> 00:57:20.640
want to let the diplomats do their jobs.

00:57:20.640 --> 00:57:25.120
I remember saying in the CIA during George W. Bush

00:57:25.120 --> 00:57:28.160
that they had never seen an administration work so hard

00:57:28.160 --> 00:57:32.760
to not talk to our enemies as we did during the Bush

00:57:32.760 --> 00:57:33.600
